# SDAECV index

Church site (SDA English Church Vellore). Next.js 16 App Router, React 19, Tailwind 4, Framer Motion, Lenis.

## Paths

- Tokens: `app/globals.css`
- Page: `app/page.tsx` + `app/layout.tsx`
- Sections: `components/` (see scoped rule when editing components)
- Session scope: `SDAECV/dev-delta.md` — read when user continues work or attaches it
- Deep docs: `SDAECV/00-index.md` → `architecture/*.md` — **on demand only**

## Commands

`npm run dev` | `build` | `start` | `lint`

## Token discipline

- Prefer `@` specific files over broad exploration
- Do **not** read `architecture/cms-wordpress.md` or `security.md` for UI-only tasks
- Phase 1 code has **no WordPress layer** yet; CMS notes are target architecture
- Update `SDAECV/dev-delta.md` when the user ends a session (if they ask)
